 r←{dry}CloneRepo y;⎕TRAP;url;path;branch;depth;cmd;rc;msg;buff
⍝ Clone a repository from given URL into given folder.
⍝ y[1] (user id & repo name) is mandatory
⍝ y[2] (path) is mandatory
 ⎕TRAP←(811 'E' '⎕DMX.EM ⎕signal 811')(0 'N')
 dry←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ 0}'dry'
 y←⊆y
 (url path branch depth)←4↑(⊆y),(≢y)↓'' '' '' 0
 cmd←'clone'
 :If 0<≢branch
     cmd,←' -b ',branch
 :EndIf
 :If 0≠depth
     cmd,←' --depth ',(⍕depth)
 :EndIf
 cmd,←' ',url,' ',path
 :If dry
     r←cmd,' ⍝ dry run'
 :Else
     (rc msg buff)←path U.RunGitCommand cmd
     ('*** ERROR',(⎕UCS 13),⊃{⍺,(⎕UCS 13),⍵}/{⍵/⍨0<≢¨⍵}msg)Assert 0=rc
     r←msg
 :EndIf
⍝Done
